    <string name="how_to_title">HOW TO PLAY</string>
    <string name="how_to_body">One run is five spins on the chosen route. Every spin costs a fixed 50 virtual credits and fills five reels from one shared symbol pool. Five fixed lines pay from the left; the golden rooster is wild and the road sign is the scatter. Three or more road signs open the road crossing bonus. Every winning spin walks the rooster one step along the route.</string>
